Package: kulan-update-center
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: kulan-base (= @VERSION@), python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.4), pkexec, apt
Recommends: timeshift, unattended-upgrades
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ Update Center and restore points
 See available updates and what's new in @NAME@, install updates with
 progress, review recent update history, and turn automatic updates on or
 off. A top-bar indicator (part of the Kulan Shell look) shows when updates
 are waiting.
 .
 Also sets up daily restore points with Timeshift, so the system can be
 rolled back if an update ever causes trouble.
